      "slug": "welcome-to-the-blog",
      "title": "Welcome to the blog",
      "excerpt": "A quick hello and what to expect from My Blog.",
      "content": "## Hello there\n\nThis is your first post. You can edit it, delete it, or ask the AI assistant to rewrite it.\n\nHere's what you can do next:\n\n- **Pick a template** in the Design tab\n\n- **Write a post** in the Posts tab (or let AI draft one)\n\n- **Publish** to GitHub Pages in one click\n\n> \n> Tip: everything you change is previewed live.\n\n>",
      "tags": [
        "welcome"
