      "title": "How this site was made",
      "excerpt": "Built with a no-code AI blog builder and published to GitHub Pages.",
      "content": "This site was created with **Blog Builder** — no code required.\n\n1. Described the blog in a sentence\n2. Chose a template and a color style\n3. Hit publish\n\nThe whole thing is static HTML, so it loads fast and costs nothing to host.",
